 4 Recognitions  │ · 1. Sign in  ✓ done
 5 Account       │      Sign in to your AudD account (or paste an API token) so
 6 Settings      │      audd can recognize music and show your account.
*7 Help          >      $ audd login --device
                 │ 
                 │   2. Recognize a file
                 │      Pick a file, URL, or folder and recognize it. Enter here
                 │      fills in AudD's example song so you can try a
                 │      recognition.
                 │      $ audd recognize https://audd.tech/example.mp3
                 │ 
                 │   3. Use the microphone
                 │      In Recognize, set Source to Microphone to record a few
                 │      seconds and identify the song.
 [ Commands ]    │      $ audd listen
